WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,110 --> 00:00:03,910
Handsome guy, I was poisoned. I have supplies. I want to exchange for an antidote pill.

2
00:00:03,910 --> 00:00:06,310
Can you help me to the side of the road so that I can avenge you?

3
00:00:06,310 --> 00:00:09,610
Why should I save you? If you're dead, the supplies are mine too.

4
00:00:09,610 --> 00:00:12,610
I have a space backpack. If I die, my backpack will disappear with me.

5
00:00:12,610 --> 00:00:16,520
As long as you save me, I will promise you anything

6
00:00:16,520 --> 00:00:20,020
You want to play beauty tricks with me? OK, I'll play with you.

7
00:00:20,020 --> 00:00:29,170
That's just paralysis

8
00:00:30,800 --> 00:00:32,800
I've been drugged and there's no harm in it

9
00:00:34,600 --> 00:00:36,600
Take out all the supplies in your space backpack

10
00:00:36,600 --> 00:00:39,100
It's enough to hide your life, I'll let you go

11
00:00:39,100 --> 00:00:41,600
I'll give it all to you, don't make any noise
